        <item>
            <title><![CDATA[馬年新年快樂！]]></title>
            <link>https://egg.lychicken.com/blog/2026NewYear</link>
            <guid>https://egg.lychicken.com/blog/2026NewYear</guid>
            <pubDate>Tue, 17 Feb 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
            <description><![CDATA[封面]]></description>
            <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><img decoding="async" loading="lazy" alt="封面" src="https://egg.lychicken.com/assets/images/news-805c668801a812328aee31b2203fc91f.webp" width="382" height="286" class="img_GotG"></p>
<blockquote>
<p>恭祝大家馬年行大運，身體健康，萬事如意！</p>
</blockquote>
<h2 class="anchor anchorTargetStickyNavbar_RfNJ" id="馬年新年新氣象">馬年新年新氣象<a href="https://egg.lychicken.com/blog/2026NewYear#%E9%A6%AC%E5%B9%B4%E6%96%B0%E5%B9%B4%E6%96%B0%E6%B0%A3%E8%B1%A1" class="hash-link" aria-label="馬年新年新氣象的直接連結" title="馬年新年新氣象的直接連結" translate="no">​</a></h2>
<p>親愛的讀者們，</p>
<p>值此馬年新春之際，蛋蛋村全體村民恭祝大家新年快樂，萬事如意！</p>
<p>馬，象徵著活力、奔騰與成功。在充滿希望的馬年，願大家都能像駿馬一樣，精神抖擻，事業騰飛，學業進步，生活美滿。</p>
<p>再次祝願大家在新的一年裡：</p>
<ul>
<li class=""><strong>身體健康</strong>：龍馬精神，活力充沛。</li>
<li class=""><strong>家庭和睦</strong>：闔家團圓，幸福美滿。</li>
<li class=""><strong>事業順利</strong>：馬到成功，步步高升。</li>
</ul>
<p>祝大家新年快樂，歲歲平安！</p>
<p>蛋蛋村敬上</p>]]></content:encoded>
